# Cursor-specific instructions

`AGENTS.md` is authoritative for shared agent roles, escalation, cost policy,
deterministic validation, architecture, safety, testing, and change discipline.
This file adds Cursor-only behavior. Do not duplicate or override `AGENTS.md`.

## Cursor Cloud and ephemeral environments

This repository has no long-running services and nothing to launch in the
background. Do not start extra daemons in a Cursor Cloud VM.

`src/gentoo-um890pro-install.sh` is destructive. Do not run it in a Cursor
Cloud VM. The Cloud environment is not a Gentoo live image and does not have
the target Minisforum EliteMini UM890 Pro NVMe disks. Missing installer
hardware is expected.

Exercise installer logic only as documented in `AGENTS.md`: source the script
with the final `main "$@"` line stripped, or run
`tests/test-install-profile-resolution.sh`.
